{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgM4WV9PTSpCihf2QDf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision — DR-9105\n\n## Step-by-Step Analysis\n\n**1. The Request**\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Request ID | DR-9105 |\n| Customer (CRM account) | CRM-2091: Acme Industrial Supply Co. |\n| Product | NS-500 Industrial Controller |\n| Requested discount | 15.0% |\n| List value | $250,000 |\n| Request date | 2026-09-23 |\n| Requestor | Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example, Enterprise Account Executive) |\n| Basis stated | Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement |\n\n**2. The Customer**\n\nThe request is for **CRM-2091** (Acme Industrial Supply Co.):\n- ERP customer: C-1044\n- DUNS: 09-552-1187\n- Tier: Standard (Midwest Mid-Market)\n- Account owner: Zachary Brown\n- Location: 17 Tallmadge Ave, Akron, OH\n\n**3. The Product**\n\nNS-500 Industrial Controller, list price $250,000.\n\n**4. Active Contract**\n\nThe request cites \"Acme Master Supply Agreement,\" but a critical issue emerges: \n\nThe **Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025)** is with:\n- **Acme Mfg. Holdings** (doing business as Acme Manufacturing)\n- CRM account: CRM-2048\n- DUNS: 04-812-7730\n- Location: 2200 N Industrial Pkwy, Milwaukee, WI\n\nThe support schedule (SUP-ACME-C) for Acme Manufacturing explicitly states:\n> \"Acme Industrial Supply Co. is a different company and is not covered.\"\n\n**Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091) is a separate legal entity** with different DUNS, address, industry classification (distribution vs. manufacturing), and account tier (Standard vs. Strategic). **No contract covers CRM-2091.**\n\n**5. Pricing Exception**\n\nThe exception **EXC-ACME-NS500-15** is schedules to **ACME-MFG-2025** and applies only to Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048). It does not cover Acme Industrial Supply Co.\n\nNo pricing exception covers this product for this customer on the request date.\n\n**6. Policy in Effect**\n\n**PRICING-POLICY-2026** (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31):\n- Enterprise Account Executives: ≤10%\n- VP Sales: >10% and ≤20%\n\n**7. Requestor's Authority**\n\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive. She is authorized to approve discounts up to 10%. The requested 15% discount exceeds her authority.\n\n**8. Required Approver**\n\nFor a 15% discount (>10% and ≤20%), approval by **VP Sales (Michael Torres)** would normally be required. However, this is secondary to the eligibility issue.\n\n**9. Commercial Eligibility**\n\nThe request relies on the \"Acme Master Supply Agreement,\" but:\n- That agreement does not cover this customer (Acme Industrial Supply Co.)\n- No contract or pricing exception establishes eligibility for CRM-2091\n- The SOP states: \"Special terms do not transfer\"\n\nThis is not a case where the contract cannot be located (it exists, but for a different customer). Rather, the special terms cited do not cover this product for this customer.\n\n---\n\n## Decision\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9105\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": 15.0,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"The cited 'Acme Master Supply Agreement' (ACME-MFG-2025) covers Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048, DUNS 04-812-7730), not Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091, DUNS 09-552-1187). The support schedule explicitly states these are different companies. No contract or exception covers Acme Industrial Supply Co.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 10,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"documents/acme_master_supply_agreement.md — applies to Acme Mfg. Holdings only\",\n    \"documents/acme_pricing_exception.md — scoped to Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"documents/acme_support_schedule_c.md — explicitly excludes Acme Industrial Supply Co.\",\n    \"structured/crm_accounts.csv — CRM-2091 is Acme Industrial Supply Co., distinct entity\",\n    \"structured/customers.csv — C-1044 (Acme Industrial Supply Co.) has different DUNS (09-552-1187) than C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings, DUNS 04-812-7730)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"A contract, pricing exception, or authorization covering Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091) for NS-500 discounts\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Requestor must clarify whether this discount is for Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091) or whether the request should have been submitted under Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048). If for CRM-2091, commercial review is required to establish whether a separate pricing agreement or exception exists or should be negotiated.\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25264,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25264},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1155c8d-be91-4b6d-971c-39cd44a25527","uuid":"acb0ed63-c598-4227-bebc-f92d9a0fd85e","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:20:16.140Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgM4BdvYwLn9mykZUK3"}
